{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yTHNEy1fAL1791301224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">法國軍方從一艘核潛艇首次試射一枚無彈頭的新型戰略核導彈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">法國總統馬克龍在法國西岸海域一艘護衛艦，觀察一枚M51.3新一代潛射彈道導彈，首次從戰略核潛艇發射升空。導彈沒有搭載核彈頭，最終墜落距離陸地數百公里的北大西洋海域。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FRA.MISSILE-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260wvTOZLV111791301237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FRA.MISSILE-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">導彈據報射程超過9,000公里，去年10月起，在法國全數4艘戰略核潛艇部署。馬克龍於今年3月宣布，法國將擴大核武庫，並計劃在歐洲盟友境內短期部署法軍核武。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T16:04:01.336066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}